## Document Types in This Collection

### Standard Practice (SP) Documents
- Provide overview and framework information
- Include occupational structure and career paths
- Define competency levels and certification requirements
- List employment prospects and working conditions

### Standard Content (SC) Documents
- Detailed competency profiles
- Assessment criteria and methods
- Tools, equipment, and materials requirements
- Training duration and delivery modes

### Curriculum of Competency Units (CoCU)
- Detailed breakdown of each competency unit
- Work activities and knowledge requirements
- Applied skills and attitudes
- Assessment criteria and employability skills

### Supporting Documents
- Executive Summaries
- Job Profiles
- Task Analysis
- Training Hour Summaries
- Contact Hour Information

